The Tenable Inventory API enables users to search for their organization's assets and the software
installed on those assets. Additionally, API endpoints are provided to retrieve a list of asset and
software properties that can be used as filters on endpoints that support them. For more
information, see Inventory in the Tenable Exposure Management User Guide.
